 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Emma just started hiking, and she wants to go solo next summer.",
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 3.937
  },
  {
   "text": "Her dad worries.",
   "start": 4.337,
   "end": 5.287
  },
  {
   "text": "So this year he skipped the gadgets and gave her the whole system.",
   "start": 5.837,
   "end": 9.065
  },
  {
   "text": "A beginner's guide, a trip planner and packing lists,",
   "start": 9.515,
   "end": 12.368
  },
  {
   "text": "a safety guide, what to do if you get lost, and a solo hiking guide.",
   "start": 12.668,
   "end": 16.888
  },
  {
   "text": "Now she leaves a trip plan on the fridge before every hike.",
   "start": 17.388,
   "end": 20.382
  },
  {
   "text": "The Ultimate Hiker's Toolkit is twenty-five percent off through December first.",
   "start": 20.882,
   "end": 25.339
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this for your gift list.",
   "start": 25.739,
   "end": 27.165
  }
